# ─── ML weights & exports ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Trained on Google Colab. Distribute via release artifacts, never git.
# model/README.md documents expected filenames, provenance and per-class metrics.
*.pt
*.pth
*.engine
*.tflite
*.weights
*.mlmodel
!model/README.md

# Ultralytics training output
runs/
wandb/
yolo*.pt

